     "text": "**CLINICAL SUMMARY - Gonzalez Ltd Clinic** \n**Patient:** Gerald Perez **DOB:** 01/26/1957 **Sex:** M **MRN:** 406335\n\n**Encounters:** \n\n- **2025-10-07** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** GERD \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 130/84 \n ***Weight:*** 183 lbs\n\n- **2025-03-20** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** Back strain \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 117/84 \n ***Weight:*** 187 lbs\n\n- **2024-08-30** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** GERD \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 131/76 \n ***Weight:*** 179 lbs\n\n- **2024-02-10** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** Musculoskeletal injury \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 131/81 \n ***Weight:*** 189 lbs\n\n- **2023-07-23** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** GERD \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 128/82 \n ***Weight:*** 187 lbs\n\n- **2023-01-02** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** Musculoskeletal injury \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 131/74 \n ***Weight:*** 188 lbs\n\n- **2022-06-15** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** Musculoskeletal injury \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 130/82 \n 189 lbs\n\n- **2021-11-25** \n ***Reason for Visit:*** GERD \n ***Blood Pressure:*** 128/78 \n ***Weight:*** 189 lbs\n\n**Assessment/Plan:** \n\n- **Musculoskeletal Injury:** \n Gerald Perez has experienced a musculoskeletal injury with an onset on December 30, 2019. the injury is well-controlled. He is prescribed cyclobenzaprine 5 mg and ibuprofen 600 mg as needed for muscle relaxation and pain relief. The patient reports no significant pain or functional limitations, indicating good control of symptoms. \n\n- **GERD:** \n Gerald Perez has been managing GERD since March 11, 2020. His condition is currently controlled, and he is on omeprazole 40 mg and pantoprazole 40 mg, both proton pump inhibitors. He reports minimal symptoms and no recent episodes of significant reflux or heartburn, suggesting effective management of his GERD. \n\n**Vital Signs Overview:** \nOver the past few years, Gerald's blood pressure readings have ranged from 117/84 to 131/84, with most readings hovering around 130/80. His weight has varied slightly, ranging from 179 lbs to 189 lbs, with an average weight of approximately 185 lbs.\n\n**Exam Findings:** \n\n- **General:** \n Gerald appears well, in no acute distress. \n- **Cardiovascular:** \n Regular rate and rhythm. No murmurs, rubs, or gallops. \n- **Respiratory:** \n Breath sounds clear bilaterally. No wheezes, rales, or rhonchi. \n- **Abdomen:** \n Soft, non-tender, no organomegaly. \n- **Extremities:** \n No edema, pulses 2+ bilaterally. \n- **Neurological:** \n Alert and oriented. Cranial nerves II-XII intact. Motor strength 5/5 in all extremities.\n\n**Social History:"
    },
